# ====================================================== 下载 / Downloads
下载 => Downloads
保存位置、并发数与速度限制 => Save location, concurrency and speed limits
保存位置 => Save location
默认下载目录 => Default download folder
新任务保存文件的位置 => Where new tasks save their files.
浏览… => Browse…
选择下载目录 => Select download folder
并发与分片 => Concurrency & pieces
最大同时下载数 => Max concurrent downloads
同时进行的任务数量（-j） => Number of tasks running at the same time (-j).
个 => items
单任务分片数 => Pieces per task
单个任务使用的连接数（-s） => Connections used by a single task (-s).
每服务器连接数 => Connections per server
对同一台服务器使用的最大连接数（-x） => Maximum connections to the same server (-x).
最小分片大小 => Minimum piece size
小于该体积的文件不再分片，支持 K / M 后缀 => Files smaller than this are not split; K / M suffixes are supported.
下载行为 => Download behavior
继续未完成的下载 => Continue unfinished downloads
启动时恢复上一次未完成的任务 => Restore unfinished tasks from the last session at startup.
断点续传 => Always resume
即使服务器不支持 Range 请求也继续下载剩余部分 => Keep downloading the rest even if the server does not support Range requests.
自动重命名 => Auto rename
同名文件存在时自动改名，不覆盖已有文件 => Rename automatically when a file with the same name exists instead of overwriting it.
允许覆盖 => Allow overwrite
允许覆盖已存在的同名文件 => Allow overwriting an existing file with the same name.
使用远程时间 => Use remote time
使用服务器上的修改时间而不是本地时间 => Use the modification time from the server instead of the local time.
文件预分配 => File preallocation
不预分配 => None
预分配 => Preallocate
快速预分配 => Fast preallocate
速度与缓存 => Speed & cache
下载限速 => Download limit
单个任务的下载速度上限，例如 512K；留空为不限速 => Download speed limit for a single task, for example 512K; leave blank for unlimited.
上传限速 => Upload limit
单个任务的上传速度上限，例如 128K；留空为不限速 => Upload speed limit for a single task, for example 128K; leave blank for unlimited.
全局下载限速 => Global download limit
所有任务合计的下载上限，0 表示不限速 => Download limit for all tasks combined; 0 means unlimited.
全局上传限速 => Global upload limit
所有任务合计的上传上限，0 表示不限速 => Upload limit for all tasks combined; 0 means unlimited.
KB/s => KB/s
磁盘缓存 => Disk cache
aria2 用于写盘的内存缓存，例如 64M；0 表示禁用 => In-memory cache aria2 uses for disk writes, for example 64M; 0 disables it.

# ==================================================== 连接 / Connection
请求标识、超时重试与 HTTP 行为 => Request identification, timeouts and HTTP behavior
请求标识 => Request identification
用户代理 => User agent
发送给服务器的 User-Agent；留空使用 aria2 默认值 => User-Agent sent to the server; leave blank to use the aria2 default.
引用页 => Referer
请求中携带的 Referer，可用于绕过防盗链 => Referer sent with requests; useful for bypassing hotlink protection.
超时与重试 => Timeouts & retries
连接超时 => Connection timeout
建立连接的最长等待时间 => Longest time to wait for a connection to be established.
传输超时 => Transfer timeout
两次数据传输之间的最长间隔 => Longest interval between two data transfers.
超时 => Timeout
整个请求的最长等待时间 => Longest time to wait for the whole request.
最大重试次数 => Max retries
连接失败后的重试次数，0 表示不重试 => Number of retries after a failed connection; 0 disables retries.
重试间隔 => Retry interval
两次重试之间的等待时间 => Wait time between two retries.
最低速度限制 => Lowest speed limit
速度低于该值时放弃任务，0 表示不限制 => Abort the task when the speed drops below this value; 0 means no limit.
秒 => seconds
次 => times
HTTP => HTTP
HTTP Keep-Alive => HTTP Keep-Alive
复用连接以减少握手开销 => Reuse connections to reduce handshake overhead.
HTTP 管线化 => HTTP pipelining
在同一条连接上连续发送多个请求 => Send several requests in a row on the same connection.
条件 GET => Conditional GET
本地文件较新时跳过下载（If-Modified-Since） => Skip the download when the local file is newer (If-Modified-Since).
使用 HEAD => Use HEAD
先用 HEAD 请求确认文件信息再开始下载 => Confirm the file information with a HEAD request before starting the download.
不发送 Want-Digest => Do not send Want-Digest
不在请求中要求服务器返回摘要信息 => Do not ask the server for digest information in requests.
流式分片选择 => Streaming piece selection
按顺序下载分片，媒体文件可以边下边看 => Download pieces in order so media files can be played while downloading.
参数化 URI => Parameterized URI
把重复的 URI 参数提取成模板后再发送 => Extract repeated URI parameters into a template before sending.
自动重命名文件 => Auto rename files
服务端文件名冲突时自动追加序号 => Append a number automatically when the server file name conflicts.

# ========================================================= 代理 / Proxy
代理 => Proxy
代理模式、服务器与身份验证 => Proxy mode, server and authentication
模式 => Mode
代理模式 => Proxy mode
不使用代理 => No proxy
跟随系统代理 => Follow system proxy
自定义代理 => Custom proxy
忽略代理 => Ignore proxy
完全禁用代理，直连所有服务器 => Disable the proxy completely and connect to all servers directly.
代理服务器 => Proxy server
全部代理 => All proxy
对所有协议生效的代理，例如 http://127.0.0.1:8080 => Proxy that applies to every protocol, for example http://127.0.0.1:8080.
HTTP 代理 => HTTP proxy
仅用于 HTTP 请求的代理地址 => Proxy address used only for HTTP requests.
HTTPS 代理 => HTTPS proxy
仅用于 HTTPS 请求的代理地址 => Proxy address used only for HTTPS requests.
FTP 代理 => FTP proxy
仅用于 FTP 请求的代理地址 => Proxy address used only for FTP requests.
身份验证 => Authentication
代理用户名 => Proxy user name
需要身份验证的代理所使用的用户名 => User name used by a proxy that requires authentication.
代理密码 => Proxy password
需要身份验证的代理所使用的密码 => Password used by a proxy that requires authentication.
例外 => Exceptions
不使用代理的地址 => Addresses without proxy
以逗号分隔的主机名，例如 localhost,127.0.0.1 => Host names separated by commas, for example localhost,127.0.0.1.

# ================================================== BitTorrent / 种子
BitTorrent => BitTorrent
监听端口、做种与 Tracker => Listen ports, seeding and Tracker
网络 => Network
监听端口 => Listen port
接受 BT 与 DHT 连接的端口，需要在防火墙中放行 => Port that accepts BT and DHT connections; it must be allowed in the firewall.
DHT 监听端口 => DHT listen port
DHT（UDP）使用的端口 => Port used for DHT (UDP).
外部 IP => External IP
对外公布的 IP 地址，用于 NAT 后的做种 => IP address announced publicly, for seeding behind NAT.
启用 DHT => Enable DHT
通过分布式哈希表寻找 Peer，无需 Tracker => Find peers through a distributed hash table without a Tracker.
启用 DHT6 => Enable DHT6
在 IPv6 网络上启用 DHT => Enable DHT on the IPv6 network.
启用 LPD => Enable LPD
通过本地网络发现同一网段内的 Peer => Find peers on the same subnet through the local network.
加密与元数据 => Encryption & metadata
需要加密 => Require encryption
只接受加密连接，拒绝明文握手 => Accept encrypted connections only; reject plaintext handshakes.
保存元数据 => Save metadata
把磁力链接解析到的元数据保存到磁盘 => Save metadata resolved from Magnet links to disk.
加载已保存的元数据 => Load saved metadata
添加磁力链接时优先使用本地已保存的元数据 => Prefer locally saved metadata when adding Magnet links.
保存元数据到 => Save metadata to
元数据文件的完整路径，留空使用默认位置 => Full path of the metadata file; leave blank to use the default location.
校验后执行钩子 => Run hook after verification
哈希校验完成后执行 --on-bt-download-complete 钩子 => Run the --on-bt-download-complete hook after hash verification.
做种比率 => Seed ratio
以 0.1 为单位，10 表示 1.0 倍分享率；0 表示不限制 => Measured in tenths; 10 means a 1.0 share ratio, 0 means no limit.
做种时间 => Seed time
下载完成后的做种分钟数，0 表示不限制 => Minutes to seed after a download finishes; 0 means no limit.
分钟 => minutes
种子未验证即做种 => Seed unverified torrents
哈希校验尚未完成时就开始上传 => Start uploading before hash verification has finished.
分离只做种任务 => Detach seed-only tasks
做种任务不再占用并发下载的名额 => Seeding tasks no longer take up concurrent download slots.
移除未选择的文件 => Remove unselected files
下载完成后删除没有被选中的文件 => Delete files that were not selected after the download finishes.
跟随 Torrent => Follow Torrent
磁力链接解析完成后自动开始下载 => Start downloading automatically once a Magnet link is resolved.
连接限制 => Connection limits
最大 Peer 数 => Max peers
单个种子允许连接的最大 Peer 数量 => Maximum number of peers one torrent may connect to.
最大打开文件数 => Max open files
同时保持打开的文件句柄上限 => Upper limit on file handles kept open at the same time.
请求超时 => Request timeout
向 Peer 请求分片的等待时间 => Wait time for requesting a piece from a peer.
停止超时 => Stop timeout
停止种子时的等待时间，0 表示立即停止 => Wait time when stopping a torrent; 0 stops immediately.
元数据超时 => Metadata timeout
等待磁力链接元数据的最长时间 => Longest time to wait for Magnet link metadata.
Tracker 间隔 => Tracker interval
向 Tracker 汇报的间隔，0 表示由服务器决定 => Interval for reporting to the Tracker; 0 lets the server decide.
Tracker 超时 => Tracker timeout
等待 Tracker 响应的最长时间 => Longest time to wait for a Tracker response.
BT 超时 => BT timeout
等待 BT 下载数据的最长时间，0 表示不限制 => Longest time to wait for BT download data; 0 means no limit.
Tracker 与 DHT => Tracker & DHT
附加 Tracker => Extra Trackers
为所有种子附加的 Tracker 地址，以逗号分隔 => Tracker addresses added to every torrent, separated by commas.
DHT 入口 => DHT entry point
加入 DHT 网络使用的入口节点 host:port => Entry node host:port used to join the DHT network.
DHT 入口 6 => DHT entry point 6
IPv6 网络上的 DHT 入口节点 => DHT entry node on the IPv6 network.
DHT 文件 => DHT file
保存 DHT 路由表的文件路径 => Path of the file that stores the DHT routing table.

