配置文件路径 => Config file path
传给 aria2 的 --conf-path，留空使用默认值 => The --conf-path passed to aria2; leave blank to use the default.
自动重启引擎 => Auto restart engine
引擎崩溃或配置变更后自动重新启动 => Restart the engine automatically after a crash or a configuration change.
随进程退出 => Stop with Fetchora
退出 Fetchora 时一并结束 aria2 进程 => End the aria2 process when Fetchora exits.
元数据下载后暂停 => Pause after metadata download
磁力链接解析完成后先暂停，等待用户确认文件 => Pause after a Magnet link is resolved so the files can be confirmed.
保留未完成的任务 => Keep unfinished tasks
退出时把未完成的任务写入会话文件 => Write unfinished tasks to the session file on exit.
会话 => Session
会话文件 => Session file
保存未完成任务列表的文件路径 => Path of the file that stores the unfinished task list.
自动保存会话 => Auto-save session
定期把任务列表写入会话文件 => Write the task list to the session file periodically.
保存间隔 => Save interval
自动保存会话的时间间隔 => Interval between automatic session saves.
附加命令行参数 => Extra command-line arguments
直接追加到 aria2c 命令行的开关，例如 --max-download-limit=1M => Switches appended directly to the aria2c command line, for example --max-download-limit=1M.
校验参数 => Verify arguments
将按当前参数重新启动 aria2 引擎；参数无效时会给出提示，已经完成的任务不会丢失。是否继续？ => The aria2 engine will restart with the current arguments. Invalid arguments are reported and finished tasks are not lost. Continue?

